  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday through next Sunday)\nIssued at 1015 PM CDT Sat Oct 24 2026\n\nTemperatures throughout the upcoming week will warm very\ngradually. We'll still enjoy relatively cool nights and warm\nafternoons for most of the week, with larger-than-normal diurnal\nspreads. However, the persistent high pressure will finally start\nto break down by week's end, and confidence is increasing that a\nweather-producing system will impact Middle Tennessee next\nweekend. In the near-term, expect drought conditions to continue\nworsening. However, there is the possibility of significant\nrainfall next Saturday and Sunday that would bring much-needed \nrelief from the dryness.",
